<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-28T23:22:54.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:22:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have launched ballistic missiles at Yemen's Aden airport twice in one day, prompting evacuation warnings, and have also fired missiles toward Saudi Arabia, with debris striking a building in Riyadh and an intercept over Taif, while a missile claim targeted the Ras Tanura refinery. Egypt's parliament has approved military support to defend Saudi Arabia, linking the conflict to broader regional involvement. Gulf states are negotiating a multipart peace deal to avoid a renewed US-Iran war. Russian satellites are being used to guide Houthi strikes on Saudi targets, contributing to higher oil prices. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOSlpYejlRTmd1MFprTGxzTHhIQi1taDhJVkMtTThYN1Y5UktONWZxcVM5TEJ2Sy1Jd25QZXFCem5uNDkzOGU3Z0NONzE1V0ZPT2E2QlJTdjZreDg0eXA5Z21MandpYmI3azQ5Q0h4azVTdHpYQnVQVGdYR3pEajBid0QtT0taZl9OVktOSUhIWjl6eGdqYlJ5RFZOd3p1LVRkVjVCVg?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQQWktallhRGk5Y3p6WmxxWktmYm5sVm5fUlRlWmE3S0t4ZE05QzNxRGFFanQ3c3pTSHpjZ1IzcDY2RUlSSlhaTjFENVExUzJ2Q0UxOGxieGlWZDVadnVsd3N0M0dBWjIxYUcwUGNfQlNVQW0wQjYyUFVubDgwY2JZV3BKa3JHRExXNW00T3lRWDVxLUJwRWVLay1HUjVVcU5wTU5xWlY5dGFxSFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPQXVwb1hReGQzckI4V3JzZXRqejJvSkxYenk2QmlSQlVVSFp3SDhod2dVeGZUYTliUUdOcllVaUlUelBYblBBVVVCNURkdk5ZelNHbkw4cEJqNmZrdjZKOVdncGUwZFdFMXJXb19ETWRJOTRkSWtRcUdVY3pXTml0TmxBdnNJSGtnX21TSElhd0R5a1F6UHY3TTVMcEtwazQ4SEl6Z2x2d0lVUTVkRFV3M1FoY2R6eW1fS1RWT0JaMjN6TUNMU3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPeU0xOG5OOVB3V2d2X0FldE9QZXJHTWpoNG8yYWJfdUdWVVBRaGNyeS0zeGlsdHB3RW9RbVYxdG